==German==

===Etymology===
{{root|de|ine-pro|*bʰer-}}
From {{inh|de|gmh|enbern}}, from {{inh|de|goh|inberan}}. Equivalent to the prefix {{prefix|de|ent|*behren}}, an obsolete verb ultimately from the root of {{m|de|gebären|t=to give birth}}. Cognate with {{cog|lb|entbieren}}, {{cog|nl|ontberen}}.

